        <mxCell id="u305NUy0W9hrtNy8YMIr-46" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;fontSize=11;" value="Solid arrow = code dependency (A depends on B). Dashed arrow = App creates / wires; App also calls the Domain operation synchronize notifications at process start, and implements the small entry interfaces that GUI and Platform services define for the objects Android creates (Activity, Stop receiver; Decision 71). Nothing depends on App. Domain has no outgoing arrows. Only Domain operations change data and timer notifications, one at a time; the Stop receiver never calls the Data operations port or the notification adapter directly (Decision 94)." vertex="1">
